{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41213706\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅为VR诱发FOG的验证研究方案，未提供实际研究数据或STN神经活动证据，对STN-FOG关系的机制判断贡献有限。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41221554\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅涉及OPA1突变帕金森病患者接受DBS治疗的病例，未提供STN神经活动或FOG相关证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41230122\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究STN-DBS长期疗效及运动症状变化，但未单独评估FOG或STN神经活动与FOG的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41261259\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接发现FOG患者包括STN在内的PPN相关通路结构异常，为PPN-STN网络损害与FOG的关系提供重要证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41270079\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究触觉提示对步态自动化及皮层活动的影响，但仅为研究方案，未直接研究FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41273953\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究STN-DBS对一般步态质量和变异性的影响，但未评估FOG，也未记录STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41281174\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较FOG与非FOG患者的FDOPA及FDG PET结果，为理解FOG相关基底节多巴胺功能和代谢网络异常提供机制背景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41301887\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"比较STN-DBS与药物治疗对平衡和一般步态的长期影响，但没有FOG特异性指标或STN神经活动数据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41340592\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"比较STN与GPi-DBS对一般步态运动学的影响，但未研究FOG或其与STN神经活动的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41346083\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述DBS后的广泛脑影像变化，但没有聚焦FOG或STN神经活动与FOG之间的联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41383649\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过操控STN刺激频率检验反应抑制，提供STN参与抑制控制的因果证据，有助于构建FOG认知-运动冲突机制的竞争性解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41386553\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"结合生物物理模型、动物实验和PD患者数据解释STN-DBS诱发电位的动态变化，有助于区分STN神经信号的突触机制、刺激效应与疾病相关变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41415889\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者相对于健康对照的STN功能连接异常，但没有区分FOG与非FOG患者，无法回答STN活动与FOG的特异性关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41420410\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较FOG与非FOG患者在步态启动认知-运动冲突下的SMA和DLPFC活动，为皮层运动准备障碍这一FOG竞争性机制提供神经生理证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41421455\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"揭示FOG相关的广泛皮层功能网络形态组织异常及转录组关联，为理解STN之外的网络脆弱性及竞争性FOG机制提供证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41443380\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"发现记忆引导眼跳潜伏期与FOG及轴性症状相关，为检验多阶段动作序列整合障碍是否构成STN-FOG关系的潜在认知机制提供依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41467420\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"主题直接涉及STN在运动控制中的作用，可为解释STN神经活动参与运动选择、抑制及相关运动障碍提供理论框架。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41467455\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究经颅直流电刺激联合步态训练对PD跌倒风险的可行性，没有STN靶点或FOG特异性证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41469687\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅为STN-DBS影像引导电极触点选择的临床试验方案，没有FOG特异性结局或实际神经活动数据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41473659\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"荟萃分析经颅刺激联合康复对一般步态和运动功能的疗效，但未涉及STN或FOG特异性机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41481735\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究小鼠动作计时与多巴胺系统的关系，既未涉及STN，也未研究帕金森病或FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41485044\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究小鼠发育性多巴胺缺失后的纹状体环路重组和运动变化，但未涉及STN或FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41485779\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅为PD虚拟现实远程康复疗效的系统综述与荟萃分析方案，没有STN或FOG特异性研究内容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41488691\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"荟萃分析DBS对PD总体运动症状的影响，虽然涉及步态疗效差异，但没有FOG特异性分析或STN神经活动证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:41492355\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究认知功能与日常步态参数的相关性，FOG仅作为次要分组因素，未提供STN或FOG特异性神经机制证据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "393240b8-93b3-4642-8b88-2905772cf0c8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T135717427317Z", "elapsed_seconds": 192.532, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T14:00:29.964848+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "12d8465e440cdf49a392f5d2e178b18ccbe1940dbe8fb8303debcf9f2c4e5ba4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T135717427317Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9ca39799512d78fea1f3ce7517142dd8e78c19c114361be118360f9b809953fb"}}}
